{# Same filter and same prose classes as challenge.jinja, so what the editor
   shows is exactly what the challenge page will render. A fenced code block is
   highlighted by Pygments through the `markdown` filter and wears the chrome
   `.prose .cocco-code` gives it in assets/styles.css. #}
<article class="prose prose-sm max-w-none">
  {{ description | markdown }}
</article>
